  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AIT will during July to November 2010 develop a research strategy. Further discussions between Sida and AIT concerning future support to research to AIT will be based on this strategy.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Asian Institute of Technology f&#xE5;r st&#xF6;d till att utveckla en  forskningsstrategi under perioden september 2010 till april 2012. Vidare diskussioner om utformningen av ett forskningssamarbete med AIT kommer att baseras p&#xE5; strategin.</narrative>
  </description>
